      "content": "Please know that what you are feeling is a profound form of grief, and it is completely understandable. The silence after a long life together can be deafening, as if a fundamental rhythm of your world has stopped. Be gentle with yourself right now; you do not need to have answers or a schedule immediately. Allow yourself the space to feel these immense feelings without judgment, even if it feels like everything is empty.",
